This is an explanatory note, not a replacement `.gitignore`.

When reconciling the repository's real `.gitignore`, make sure it does NOT ignore:
- `.kiro/`
- `.kiro/steering/`
- `.kiro/specs/`
- `.kiro/hooks/`

The Kiroween 2026 rules require the repository-root `.kiro/` directory to be included in the public GitHub repository.
